{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本標準依都市更新條例（以下簡稱本條例）第六十五條第四項規定訂定之\n\n。","id":"苗栗縣-GL000203/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"ac81c10557dc199c31ec1cc6b571694a53aa66db7c971dddc72baf85d8c99026","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"本標準之主管機關為苗栗縣政府。","id":"苗栗縣-GL000203/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"52924b989b8feb4080def3d0d105849ad3f3f7a0eb5b74f7c3c63c2ec873bf2b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"本標準適用對象，指於本條例第七條或第八條所定迅行或策略性更新地區\n\n內實施之都市更新事業。","id":"苗栗縣-GL000203/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"16f87ed0e5a1987aa7508fc784ff1efd7b686c0282ee58b15cbb98ff6fa60155","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"更新單元放寬建蔽率以住宅區為限，且不得超過原建蔽率。\n\n依本標準放寬建蔽率之案件，仍應符合建築法令及都市計畫法令之退縮建\n\n築規定。","id":"苗栗縣-GL000203/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"b8ecffcc0c5d860f8b6dca63539a7b098a83b597de538026937aac55022eb43d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"更新單元之建築物高度，除飛航安全管制及軍事管制外，不受建築法令及\n\n都市計畫法令之建築高度限制。","id":"苗栗縣-GL000203/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"1aacbd2aa60b904a9a04e294eea8c307efeeaccff84712034912106478f351f0","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"本標準自發布日施行。","id":"苗栗縣-GL000203/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"0760487a7e1a3f98a433704c163a939df3ca09942ff350f224457b344857930a","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"苗栗縣-GL000203","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"","name":"苗栗縣迅行及策略性更新地區建築物高度及建蔽率放寬標準","region":"苗栗縣","source":"苗栗縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://law.miaoli.gov.tw/glrsnewsout/LawContent.aspx?id=GL000203","retrieved":"2026-09-28T09:57:52+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"c12c316b0de6d37e73470759c6111072ff7d72d8cad5bf7672af87739239664a","sourceRecordId":"苗栗縣-GL000203","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T10:03:59+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"","effectiveDate":""}}